# Preview builds only by agreement

Never start, queue, or retry an EAS preview build (`--profile preview`, preview APK, or the same build under another name) unless the user has explicitly agreed to that build in the current conversation.

A bug report, a splash fix, or "this should be on the phone" is not agreement. Finish the code change and stop. Ask before the build.

Cancel a preview build immediately if the user says to stop it.
